---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Abdurakhmon Dadaboev"
  description="Portfolio of Abdurakhmon Dadaboev, a computer vision researcher working on road image data, segmentation, retrieval, and offline OCR."
>
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Hello, I’m</p>
      <h1>Alex</h1>
      <p class="role">Computer vision researcher and engineer.</p>
      <p class="summary">
        I value work that is reliable and honest. AI is becoming a normal part of research and industry, and more of the process can now be automated. Even so, people should remain involved where judgment matters most: choosing a worthwhile problem, checking the result, and taking responsibility for how it is used.
      </p>
      <p class="summary">
        I often find that data is the real bottleneck. Larger models and more complex architectures receive much of the attention, but practical systems depend on accurate, well organized, and relevant information. Compute and tokens can be purchased. Useful context has to be built. My training has prepared me for this part of AI, and I continue to explore it through data collection, curation, retrieval, labeling, and evaluation.
      </p>
      <p class="summary">
        I also value teamwork and clear communication. I have worked with people from different companies, countries, fields, and personalities. There is no single formula for a good team, but I have learned that being genuinely present makes a real difference: listening carefully, understanding what others need, and speaking openly before small problems become large ones.
      </p>
      <div class="profile-links" aria-label="Profile links">
        <a href="https://github.com/AlexL71" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abdurakhmon-dadaboev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="/resume">Resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="portrait-block">
      <img src="/images/home-portrait.jpg" width="1280" height="1280" alt="Abdurakhmon Dadaboev" loading="eager" />
      <figcaption>
        <strong>Abdurakhmon Dadaboev</strong>
        <span>Uzbekistan · 27 years old</span>
        <span>B.S. in Electronic Engineering</span>
        <span>M.S. in Big Data Science, Korea University · August 2026</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="current-heading">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Now</p><h2 id="current-heading">What I’m working on</h2></div>
      <a href="/resume">Full experience →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="current-grid">
      <article>
        <span>Since 2026</span>
        <h3>North American road data</h3>
        <p>I collect and filter Mapillary images, then use DINOv3 and FAISS to find similar road scenes. A small review tool keeps a person in the loop.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Since 2026</span>
        <h3>Offline exam OCR</h3>
        <p>I’m connecting page alignment, student matching, answer extraction, OCR, and result storage in one offline application.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>July 2026</span>
        <h3>Youngchang Labs internship</h3>
        <p>I worked on road image data collection and analysis, and supported computer vision model development.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h2 id="projects-heading">Projects</h2></div>
      <a href="/research-and-projects">All projects →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-grid">
      <a href="/research-and-projects/north-american-road-data">
        <span>Data pipeline · 2026</span>
        <h3>North American road data pipeline</h3>
        <p>Mapillary collection, DINOv3 features, FAISS retrieval, and human review.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/research-and-projects/road-damage-detection">
        <span>Computer vision · 2025</span>
        <h3>Road damage segmentation</h3>
        <p>Polygon based crack and pothole segmentation with severity classification.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/research-and-projects/omr-htr-digitization">
        <span>Applied AI · 2026</span>
        <h3>Offline exam OMR and OCR</h3>
        <p>A local application for matching students, reading answers, and saving results.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/research-and-projects/semantic-segmentation-modality-reduction">
        <span>Research paper · 2025</span>
        <h3>Efficient semantic segmentation</h3>
        <p>Knowledge distillation from RGB, NIR, and LiDAR to an RGB only model.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section details-grid" aria-label="Education and technical skills">
    <div class="details-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Education</p>
      <h2>Academic background</h2>
      <div class="detail-item"><strong>M.S. Big Data Science</strong><span><a class="institution-link" href="https://bigdatascience.korea.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Korea University, Sejong</a> · 2024 to 2026</span><span>GPA 4.46 / 4.5</span></div>
      <div class="detail-item"><strong>B.S. Electronic Engineering</strong><span><a class="institution-link" href="https://electric.sunmoon.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sun Moon University</a> · 2019 to 2023</span><span>GPA 4.18 / 4.5</span></div>
      <div class="detail-item"><strong>Korean Language Program</strong><span><a class="institution-link" href="https://kli.sunmoon.ac.kr/new_en/web/page1-1.asp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sun Moon University Korean Language Institute</a> · Sep 2017 to Dec 2018</span><span>Completed the highest-level class (Level 7) · TOPIK Level 6</span></div>
      <div class="detail-item"><strong>Automated Systems Maintenance and Commissioning</strong><span><a class="institution-link" href="https://institutions.ziyonet.uz/object/show/20815" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andijan College of Transport and Services</a> · Sep 2013 to Jun 2016</span><span>GPA 5.0 / 5.0 · Graduated with honors (red diploma)</span></div>
      <div class="detail-item"><strong>Fine Arts</strong><span><a class="institution-link" href="https://art-academy.uz/blog/news/ozbekiston-tasviriy-va-amaliy-sanatini-yanada-rivojlantirishda-andijon-maktabining-orni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andijan Specialized Boarding School of Arts</a> · Sep 2008 to May 2013</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="details-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Skills</p>
      <h2>Tools I use</h2>
      <p><strong>Computer vision</strong><br />Segmentation, classification, retrieval, OCR, and knowledge distillation</p>
      <p><strong>Development</strong><br />Python, PyTorch, OpenCV, Ultralytics YOLO, DINOv3, FAISS, SQLite, and Git</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 48rem) clamp(13rem, 18vw, 16rem); justify-content: center; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3.5rem); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem); }
    .intro h1 { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .role { margin-bottom: 1.6rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.28rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .summary { max-width: 48rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.82; }
    .profile-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.65rem 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .profile-links a, .section-title > a { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.94rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .profile-links a { padding-bottom: 0.12rem; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; }
    .profile-links a:hover { border-color: currentColor; }
    .portrait-block { margin: 0; }
    .portrait-block img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: var(--radius-md); object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .portrait-block figcaption { margin-top: 0.9rem; }
    .portrait-block strong, .portrait-block span { display: block; }
    .portrait-block strong { color: var(--ink); font-size: 0.86rem; }
    .portrait-block span { margin-top: 0.15rem; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .home-section { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .section-title { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; }
    .section-title .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .current-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 19rem), 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .current-grid article, .project-grid a, .details-panel { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .current-grid article { padding: 1.45rem; }
    .current-grid span, .project-grid > a > span { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .current-grid h3, .project-grid h3 { margin: 0.65rem 0 0.45rem; }
    .current-grid p, .project-grid p { font-size: 0.96rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .project-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 27rem), 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .project-grid a { padding: 1.5rem; transition: border-color var(--transition), transform var(--transition); }
    .project-grid a:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .project-grid h3 { font-size: 1.18rem; }
    .details-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 27rem), 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .details-panel { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem); }
    .details-panel h2 { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
    .detail-item { padding-block: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .detail-item strong, .detail-item span { display: block; }
    .detail-item strong { margin-bottom: 0.2rem; font-size: 1rem; }
    .detail-item span, .details-panel > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.94rem; }
    .details-panel > p:not(.eyebrow) + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
    .details-panel p strong { color: var(--ink); }
    @media (max-width: 1100px) { .intro { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) clamp(10rem, 23vw, 13rem); justify-content: stretch; gap: 2rem; } }
    @media (max-width: 680px) { .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .portrait-block { max-width: 12rem; } .project-grid, .details-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .section-title { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } }
  </style>
</Layout>
